EulerPilot
==========

EulerPilot is an openEuler-oriented adaptive resource-control Agent project
for the China Graduate Operating System Open Source Innovation Competition.

Copyright (c) 2026 EulerPilot contributors.

This repository contains original EulerPilot source code, experiment scripts,
documentation, Web Console code, and competition evidence. Third-party
reference material, when present under third_party/reference/, is kept for
engineering comparison and citation only. Such material remains governed by
its original upstream license and notice files.

See docs/reference_repos.md for the reference-source boundary used by this
project.
